		<outline text="BBC Visit">
			<outline text="Move contracts"/>
			</outline>
		<outline text="IndieFeeds">
			<outline text="eMail">
				<outline text="From: 	  Jason Evangelho &lt;jasonevangelho@gmail.com&gt;"/>
				<outline text="Subject: 	Getting involved with IndieFeed (Please Read :-)"/>
				<outline text="Date: 	November 9, 2004 11:48:41 PM CET"/>
				<outline text="To: 	  Adam Curry &lt;adam@curry.com&gt;"/>
				<outline text="Reply-To: 	  Jason Evangelho &lt;jasonevangelho@gmail.com&gt;"/>
				<outline text=""/>
				<outline text="Hey Adam;"/>
				<outline text="This is Jason @ Hardcore Insomnia Radio. "/>
				<outline text="You recently had proposed that listeners out here in podcasting land"/>
				<outline text="hunt down great music by indie bands and you would produce the show."/>
				<outline text="However, I'd like to steer you in a different direction."/>
				<outline text=""/>
				<outline text="I have teamed up with Chris at Indiefeed and truly believe that this"/>
				<outline text="has major potential for promoting bands. He is already having talks"/>
				<outline text="with labels about sending us their catalogues and things are moving"/>
				<outline text="quickly in a positive direction. So, what better way to recruit help,"/>
				<outline text="then asking the grandmaster AC (boiiiing)  for some help?"/>
				<outline text=""/>
				<outline text="basically, we would need you to ask people via the Daily Source Code"/>
				<outline text="if anyone would be interested in helping to maintain certain"/>
				<outline text="IndieFeeds. I am handling the Alt/Modern Rock channel with Chris, but"/>
				<outline text="the more movement and activity we get behind this, the more successful"/>
				<outline text="it will be. It truly has some amazing potential."/>
				<outline text=""/>
				<outline text="So, pretty please, give IndieFeed another mention and let's start"/>
				<outline text="rolling on this. If you need any questions answered, contact myself of"/>
				<outline text="Chris over at Indie Feed."/>
				<outline text=""/>
				<outline text="Thanks Adam......."/>
				<outline text="Jason"/>
				<outline text="http://hardcoreinsomniaradio.blogspot.com"/>
				<outline text="-- "/>
				<outline text="&quot;The chains of habit are too weak to be felt until they are too"/>
				<outline text="strong to be broken.&quot;"/>
				<outline text="~Samuel Johnson"/>
				</outline>
			</outline>
